Round: #499.  Subject: discharge `accept tlba`, `accept tlbb`, `accept tlbc` by MEASURED KILL.
Baseline: HEAD e898c84, file src/devices/dev_sgi_re.c unmodified.
Detector under test: regress/artifacts/sgireunmapped/opus_witness_20260830/detector.py

